{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-33466","model_call":7,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"improve team performance\" coach (+ communication motivation \"goal setting\"))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"improve team performance\" coach (+ communication motivation \"goal setting\"))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_1364749777#3_2865824888","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q3365","rank":1,"snippet":"the Weak Links 14) Believe in Your Team You Can Be a Great Coach Share this Image On Your Site \" , \"segment\": \"Your relationship as a coach should revolve around honesty and positivity. Your players look up to you as a role model and a mentor, and you need to exemplify that. To help strengthen your relationship with your players, consider hosting events outside of practice time. Take the team on a lake trip or host a BBQ on the weekend. Let your players get to meet the real you, off the field. 2) Always Be Learning As a <cover>coach, you should always be learning. Read something new every day. Read about tactics other teams and coaches are trying to boost results. Read about fitness, nutrition, and motivation. Every day you expect your athletes to be growing as individuals, to keep pushing themselves and educating themselves as well.\" , \"start_char\": 1193.000000 , \"title\": \"14 Ways For Coaches To Improve Team Performance!</cover>\" , \"url\": \"https://www.justfundraising.com/blog/14-ways-for-coaches-to-improve-team-performance/\" }"},"time":149},"model_calls":7,"document_judgments":5,"relevance_3":2,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
